WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.023
- Well, hello there.

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:03.040
I patiently sit here,

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.870
waiting for the Lex Clips YouTube channel

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:08.730
to go from zero to 20k subscribers.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:11.360
Once it does, I will post clips to it,

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.430
from the Artificial Intelligence podcast

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.380
and other related lectures, talks

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:17.150
that I and others have given.

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:18.840
Someone on Twitter mentioned

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.120
that it doesn't make sense
to subscribe to a channel

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.223
with no content.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:26.180
Very well, dear Twitter friend.

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:28.150
Here is your content.

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:29.570
Please now watch

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:32.790
this one-time, unrelated
but necessary video

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:35.420
of a puppy enjoying a belly rub.

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:39.333
I dare you to not subscribe
and click the bell icon.

